              {
                "lineHeight": "1.4",
                "fontStyle": "normal",
                "textTransform": "none",
                "textAlign": "left",
                "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
                "fontSize": "28",
                "fontWeight": "400",
                "textDirection": "ltr",
                "fontVariantId": "normal-400",
                "textDecoration": "none",
                "letterSpacing": "0",
                "fills": [
                  {
                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "Departures from frame 13 that shipped with the app: the lock note moved from inside the Record as row to under the Interface row, covering both locks; the vertical gaps tightened (cards to Record as 56 to 40, rows to Pan\/trim 58 to 48, lock note to Pan\/trim 89 to 66) so the locked page with a clipping input and the gain note still fits above the bottom edge. The app draws the choices as separate LoopChoiceRow boxes and the switches as LoopSwitch; these frames keep this page's segmented group and a plain switch for the same controls."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
